# Every backend route, against the local stack (tools/localdev/stack.sh up).
# Works in VS Code (REST Client), Rider and Visual Studio.
#
# Auth: the API only takes the mp_sid session cookie (tokens never leave the server; the Keycloak clients have
# no password grant). Get a session per player, then paste it below:
#   SID_ONLY=1 tools/localdev/verify-auth.sh                                    # testuser
#   SID_ONLY=1 USER_NAME=player PASSWORD='Player123!' tools/localdev/verify-auth.sh   # player
# or open {{host}}/api/auth/login in a browser and copy the mp_sid cookie of api.chess.localhost.
#
# Ids in routes are lower-case Guids, with or without dashes (paste them straight from a response).

@host = http://api.chess.localhost
@sid = paste-testuser-mp_sid-here
@sid2 = paste-player-mp_sid-here
@tc = 5+3
@gameId = 00000000000000000000000000000000
@inviteId = 00000000000000000000000000000000
@aggregateId = paste-from-dead-letter-list

### ---------- auth (browser flow; shown for completeness) ----------

### Start login: 302 to Keycloak, sets mp_pkce
GET {{host}}/api/auth/login?returnTo=/

### Keycloak redirects here with code+state; sets mp_sid and 302s to the app
# GET {{host}}/api/auth/callback?code=...&state=...

### Who am I (also JIT-provisions the users row)
GET {{host}}/api/me
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### Logout: revokes the session row, then the IdP session
GET {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### Health (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/health

### ---------- matchmaking ----------

### Join a queue (always seeks a new game) → waiting | matched
POST {{host}}/api/matchmaking/{{tc}}
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### Keep your place while waiting (every ~30 s; 60 s silence drops you); answers matched if you were just paired
POST {{host}}/api/matchmaking/{{tc}}?heartbeat=true
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### Second player: gets matched
POST {{host}}/api/matchmaking/{{tc}}
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid2}}

### Leave the queue → 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/matchmaking/{{tc}}
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### ---------- invites ----------

### Create (color: white | black | random) → 201
POST {{host}}/api/invites
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timeControl": "{{tc}}", "color": "white" }

### Read → open | accepted (with gameId) | cancelled | expired
GET {{host}}/api/invites/{{inviteId}}
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid2}}

### Accept (anyone but the creator) → the game starts; a second accept is 409
POST {{host}}/api/invites/{{inviteId}}/accept
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid2}}

### Cancel (creator only, while open)
POST {{host}}/api/invites/{{inviteId}}/cancel
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### ---------- games: commands (the actor) ----------

### Move (UCI; promotion as e7e8q)
POST {{host}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/moves
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "uci": "e2e4" }

### Resign (after the first move)
POST {{host}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/resign
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### Offer a draw
POST {{host}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/draw/offer
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### Accept the opponent's draw offer
POST {{host}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/draw/accept
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid2}}

### Decline the opponent's draw offer
POST {{host}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/draw/decline
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid2}}

### Abort (before your first move)
POST {{host}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/abort
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### Live view (the actor while playing; the replica once ended)
GET {{host}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/live
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### ---------- games: read side (replica, keyset paged) ----------

### All games (status: open | playing | ended | aborted; limit ≤ 200; cursor from nextCursor)
GET {{host}}/api/games?status=ended&limit=20
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### My games
GET {{host}}/api/me/games?limit=20
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### One game
GET {{host}}/api/games/{{gameId}}
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### Its moves
GET {{host}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/moves
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### Its PGN (after the end)
GET {{host}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/pgn
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### ---------- pings (Part 0 spine) ----------

### Send a ping to an actor
POST {{host}}/api/pings/demo-1
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "hello" }

### Its live state (actor)
GET {{host}}/api/pings/demo-1/live
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### List (replica)
GET {{host}}/api/pings?limit=50
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### ---------- admin (role Admin) ----------

### Parked projection records
GET {{host}}/api/admin/projections/dead-letters
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

### Replay one quarantined aggregate (groupId and aggregateId exactly as the dead-letter list shows them;
# groups: chess.rm-games, chess.rm-pings)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/projections/chess.rm-games/dead-letters/{{aggregateId}}/replay
Cookie: mp_sid={{sid}}

# The live hub (/hub/live) is SignalR for the BFF's Relay service account only — not callable from here.
